## Shared files (extra caution)

These affect attendee **and** other surfaces. Editing them requires passcode **4778** if the change impacts attendee UI, fonts, colors, layout, nav, or artboard sizing:

- `app/layout.tsx`, `app/globals.css`, `lib/routes.ts`, `lib/responsive.ts`

Prefer production-scoped changes (`lib/parable/**`, `styles/parable-production.css`, `components/parable/**`) when the task is production-only.

## Explicitly NOT attendee (no passcode required)

Production / operator / crew tooling:

- `app/ops/**`, `app/production/**`, `app/production-dashboard/**`
- `app/dashboard/broadcast/**`, `app/dashboard/todays-service/**`, `app/dashboard/incidents/**`
- `components/ops/**`, `components/production/**`, `components/todays-service/**`, `components/incidents/**`, `components/broadcast/**`, `components/parable/**`
- `lib/ops/**`, `lib/production/**`, `lib/todays-service/**`, `lib/incidents/**`, `lib/broadcast/**`, `lib/parable/**`, `backend/**`

